Return JSON code/report. Write a straightforward executable Python script check_real.py using pathlib hashlib json io copy Bio.SeqIO. root = Path(__file__).resolve().parent. Load root/local_features.json, choose first entry source path, read file bytes and SHA256 before. Parse with SeqIO.read(path,'snapgene'). Deepcopy record. Set molecule_type DNA. Write to io.StringIO using genbank, read back. Assert sequence equal; topology equal; number features equal; for each zipped feature assert location equal, type equal, qualifiers equal. Assert input SHA256 unchanged. Print JSON source path sequence_length feature_count roundtrip_passed true. No files written or input modifications. Main guard. Under 50 lines. Do not add tests of matching or benchmarking claims.
